  <!--EN: Training that increases damage and accuracy when using a bow.
	
Level 0: Hearing and Sight +20%, +20% bow damage
Level 1: Hearing and Sight +40%, +40% bow damage
Level 2: Hearing and Sight +60%, Breathing +15%, +60% bow damage
Level 3: Hearing and Sight +80%, Breathing +25%, Blood filtration +10%, +80% bow damage-->
  <TM_BowTraining.description>用来升级使用者的被动增益。此能力仅需要在提升弓箭精通时使用。\n	\nLevel 0: 听觉和视觉+20%，+20%基础伤害\nLevel 1: 听觉和视觉+40%，+40%基础伤害\nLevel 2: 听觉和视觉+60%，呼吸+15% ,+60%基础伤害\nLevel 3: 听觉和视觉+80%，呼吸+25%，血液循环+10%，+80%基础伤害</TM_BowTraining.description>
  <!--EN: Bow Training-->
  <TM_BowTraining.label>弓箭精通</TM_BowTraining.label>
  <!--EN: The ranger uses a dose of druidic poison to arm a wooden trap. Traps last indefinitely, but a ranger is only able to deploy a limited number at a time.

Enemies caught in the poison will take 1-8 poison damage every 0.66 seconds. Poison damage also applies a slowing effect. Traps will never be triggered by animals.-->
  <TM_PoisonTrap.description>一个由刺和细绳组成的陷阱， 它可以完美地与地形贴合从而骗过未经训练的眼睛， 但是它的气味会给动物们一个明显的警告. 当一个受害者触发陷阱，德鲁伊之毒的粒子将会排放到空气中. 这种毒同时用来伤害和使受害者失去行动能力。</TM_PoisonTrap.description>
  <!--EN: Poison Trap-->
  <TM_PoisonTrap.label>毒药陷阱</TM_PoisonTrap.label>
  <!--EN: Training that the ranger's professional skills. Each level will increase the ranger trait to reflect the skill of the ranger.
	
Ranks:
Woodsman: Speed +0.15c/s, Aiming Delay -15%, Immunity Gain +20%, Comf. Temperature +-10C., Toxic Sensitivity -10%
Tame and train animal +5%, butchering speed +5%, smelting and construction speed -10%

Hunter: Speed +0.2c/s, Aiming Delay -20%, Immunity Gain +25%, Comf. Temperature +-15C., Toxic Sensitivity -15%
Tame and train animal +8%, butchering speed +10%, smelting and construction speed -15%

Scout: Speed +0.25c/s, Aiming Delay -30%, Immunity Gain +30%, Comf. Temperature +-18C., Toxic Sensitivity -20%
Tame and train animal +10%, butchering speed +15%, smelting and construction speed -18%

Ranger: Speed +0.3c/s, Aiming Delay -40%, Immunity Gain +35%, Comf. Temperature +-25C., Toxic Sensitivity -25%
Tame and train animal +12%, butchering speed +20%, smelting and construction speed -20%-->
  <TM_RangerTraining.description>用来升级猎人特性。此能力只需要在训练完成后使用。\n	\n等级:\n见习猎人: 移动速度+0.15c/s，瞄准延迟-15%，免疫增益+20%，舒适温度+-10C，毒性敏感性-10% \n驯养和训练动物+5%，屠宰速度+5%，冶炼和建造速度-10% \n\n初级猎人: 移动速度+0.2c/s，瞄准延迟-20%，免疫增益+25%，舒适温度+-15C，毒性敏感性-15% \n驯养和训练动物+8%，屠宰速度+10%，冶炼和建造速度-15% \n\n高级猎人: 移动速度+0.25c/s，瞄准延迟-30%，免疫增益+30%，舒适温度+-18C，毒性敏感性-20% \n驯养和训练动物+10%，屠宰速度+15%，冶炼和建造速度-18% \n\n传奇猎人: 移动速度+0.3c/s，瞄准延迟-40%，免疫增益+35%，舒适温度+-25C，毒性敏感性-25% \n驯养和训练动物+12%，屠宰速度+20%，冶炼和建造速度-20%</TM_RangerTraining.description>
  <!--EN: Ranger Training-->
  <TM_RangerTraining.label>猎人训练</TM_RangerTraining.label>
